# Understand-Anything (Lum1104) tool eval — local-only, never commit
/.understand-anything/

# Ad-hoc UI verification harnesses (Playwright) + their screenshot evidence.
# Convention per docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-02..04: created untracked, "do NOT
# commit" — the script source lives inline in each plan doc, so they are regenerable.
# CI's WASM smoke test is the tracked exception (negated below); if a future verify
# script must be committed, add its own negation here.
scripts/verify-*.mjs
!scripts/verify-wasm-smoke.mjs
scripts/capture-*.mjs
scripts/walk-*.mjs
# Legacy: older harnesses wrote evidence into the curated design-handoff folder;
# guarded here so it never commits. New evidence goes to screenshots/ (above).
design-handoff/ui-screenshots/verify-*.png
design-handoff/ui-screenshots/walk-*.png

# Corpus de research (papers PDF/XML + índices generados) — local-only, ~470 MB.
# Los 18 issues del programa research 2026-08 (#993-#1010, índice #1011) citan
# rutas bajo docs/research/; el corpus vive en la máquina, no en el historial.
# Los 3 .md curados ya trackeados aquí siguen versionados (git ignora la regla
# para archivos ya trackeados) — son los que enlaza CLAUDE.md.
docs/research/

# graphify knowledge graph (local, regenerable con: graphify extract . --code-only)
/graphify-out/
AGENTS.md.pre-graphify.bak

# Scratch de recon (prompts, issues en borrador, salidas de codex, capturas de
# replay-maria) — evidencia de trabajo, no documentación curada.
/.recon/

# Evidencia de verificación de las tandas (bitácoras, trazas de Playwright,
# capturas, logs de gates) — misma regla que screenshots/: se cita desde los
# informes en docs/reports/, no se versiona.
/artifacts/
